    the transport-failure error state -> renders "أعد المحاولة" (Retry) /
    "حدث خطأ ما" (Something went wrong) / "يرجى المحاولة مرة أخرى" (Please
    try again) / "رجوع" (Back), correctly using the existing translated
    keys, no truncation/overflow observed. Screenshot:
    regression-rtl-arabic-NErrorRetry.png
  - Schedule pills / cover image: campaigns 1 and 2 both seed start_time/
    end_time/start_date/end_date = NULL, so the schedule-pill branch
    (`basicCampaign!.startTime != null`) never renders for EITHER fixture —
    not exercisable with current seed data (not a defect; noted as a data
    gap, same shape as the pre-existing NEARS-1095 storeless-module trap).
    Cover image (SliverAppBar `flexibleSpace.background: NImage(...)`) is
    structurally outside the `hasError` conditional in campaign_screen.dart
    (sibling to the branching Column, not nested inside it) — confirmed by
    direct source read; no crash/red-screen observed on any of the 3 states
    exercised (success/error/empty) which would be the observable symptom
    of that composition breaking.

